interleukin-2 compared with interleukin-2 alone in patients with metastatic melanoma</article-title><source>Support Care Cancer</source><year>2003</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>304</fpage><lpage>12</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12720074</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn id="fn1-co14_1p021"><p>Cancer Care Ontario&#x02019;s Program in Evidence-based Care is sponsored by Cancer Care Ontario and the Ministry of Health and Long-Term Care.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>